{"4928160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kuma & Friends: Can You Save Everyone?", "steam_appid": 4928160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devastating earthquake shattered the land, awakening the dead from their graves. As chaos spread, survivors fled in every direction, becoming trapped in haunted locations overrun by the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned villages, haunted forests, eerie farms, and other mysterious places. Search for supplies, rescue stranded survivors, gather resources, and upgrade your camp. Every location hides valuable loot, but also terrifying surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, survive relentless waves of the undead while avoiding terrifying bosses, each with unique behaviors and frightening encounters. Some horrors cannot be defeated. Sometimes, your only option is to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every choice matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you risk everything to rescue every survivor, or leave others behind to improve your own chances of survival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions determine who lives, who dies, what events unfold, and which of the multiple endings you'll reach. Every playthrough offers new discoveries, unexpected scares, and different outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with a friend in local co-op as you explore, rescue survivors, strengthen your camp, and fight to survive until dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you save everyone... or only yourself?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devastating earthquake shattered the land, awakening the dead from their graves. As chaos spread, survivors fled in every direction, becoming trapped in haunted locations overrun by the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned villages, haunted forests, eerie farms, and other mysterious places. Search for supplies, rescue stranded survivors, gather resources, and upgrade your camp. Every location hides valuable loot, but also terrifying surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, survive relentless waves of the undead while avoiding terrifying bosses, each with unique behaviors and frightening encounters. Some horrors cannot be defeated. Sometimes, your only option is to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every choice matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you risk everything to rescue every survivor, or leave others behind to improve your own chances of survival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions determine who lives, who dies, what events unfold, and which of the multiple endings you'll reach. Every playthrough offers new discoveries, unexpected scares, and different outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with a friend in local co-op as you explore, rescue survivors, strengthen your camp, and fight to survive until dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you save everyone... or only yourself?</strong></p>", "short_description": "Kuma &amp; Friends: Can You Save Everyone? is a horror adventure game where every choice matters. Rescue survivors, explore haunted locations, and survive the night. Every decision you make shapes the story and determines which ending you'll reach.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928160/396f9d1bf59c15cd92a7615d1e85fd6a256d4e88/header.jpg?t=1784046706", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928160/895d3f5ea33f0b3418d5cc060f33e0a514a4af77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784046706", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928160/895d3f5ea33f0b3418d5cc060f33e0a514a4af77/capsule_184x69.